1
00:00:00,078 --> 00:00:01,259
You're standing at the

2
00:00:01,259 --> 00:00:02,191
edge of a decision

3
00:00:02,191 --> 00:00:03,248
you can't take back,

4
00:00:03,768 --> 00:00:06,442
heart pounding, palms sweating,

5
00:00:06,442 --> 00:00:07,874
waiting for a sign

6
00:00:07,874 --> 00:00:09,307
that never comes.

7
00:00:10,117 --> 00:00:11,938
Fear doesn't ask permission.

8
00:00:12,637 --> 00:00:13,615
It walks in and

9
00:00:13,615 --> 00:00:15,570
starts talking, telling you

10
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:17,118
everything that could

11
00:00:17,118 --> 00:00:18,211
go wrong before

12
00:00:18,211 --> 00:00:19,557
you've even tried.

13
00:00:20,387 --> 00:00:21,451
But faith doesn't

14
00:00:21,451 --> 00:00:22,657
wait for certainty.

15
00:00:23,428 --> 00:00:25,279
Faith moves while the

16
00:00:25,279 --> 00:00:27,542
outcome is still unknown,

17
00:00:27,542 --> 00:00:29,085
one unsteady step

18
00:00:29,085 --> 00:00:29,908
at a time.

19
00:00:30,547 --> 00:00:31,624
You don't need proof

20
00:00:31,624 --> 00:00:32,448
it'll work out.

21
00:00:33,017 --> 00:00:33,905
You need enough

22
00:00:33,905 --> 00:00:34,997
courage for today.

23
00:00:35,637 --> 00:00:36,886
The moment you stop

24
00:00:36,886 --> 00:00:38,761
demanding answers and start

25
00:00:38,761 --> 00:00:40,088
trusting the One who

26
00:00:40,098 --> 00:00:42,164
already has them, fear

27
00:00:42,164 --> 00:00:43,577
loses its grip.

28
00:00:44,488 --> 00:00:45,689
Fear ends where

29
00:00:45,689 --> 00:00:46,797
faith begins.

